\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces The cost of achieving a particular MAE (left and center left) and pairwise ranking error (center right and right) when using different benchmark score estimators on SWE-bench Verified and Terminal-Bench 2.0. Stars indicate the cost of producing the true benchmark score. An ideal method has low error (to the left) and is cheap (lower). Costs are calculated at a nominal \$2 per task execution. Values are estimated using the leave-one-family-out results underlying Table\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:hero} and, for pairwise error, leave-two-out comparisons of system pairs whose true scores differ by at least 0.05.}}{8}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cost}{{5}{8}{The cost of achieving a particular MAE (left and center left) and pairwise ranking error (center right and right) when using different benchmark score estimators on SWE-bench Verified and Terminal-Bench 2.0. Stars indicate the cost of producing the true benchmark score. An ideal method has low error (to the left) and is cheap (lower). Costs are calculated at a nominal \$2 per task execution. Values are estimated using the leave-one-family-out results underlying Table~\ref {tab:hero} and, for pairwise error, leave-two-out comparisons of system pairs whose true scores differ by at least 0.05}{figure.5}{}}
